{"overview":"در اواخر قرن نوزدهم، اشرافیت امپراتوری بریتانیا بر سرزمین حکمرانی می‌کند در حالی که طبقه کارگر تحت ستم آن‌ها رنج می‌برد. ویلیام جیمز موریارتی که به وضعیت آن‌ها همدردی می‌کند، می‌خواهد همه‌چیز را براندازد. موریارتی که از نابرابری‌های ساختاری خسته شده، نقشه‌ای می‌کشد تا کل کشور را اصلاح کند؛ حتی کارآگاه شرلوک هلمز هم نمی‌تواند مانع او شود. زمان آن رسیده که جرم، جهان را متحول کند!","tagline":"","overview_en":"In the late 19th century, the British Empire nobility reigns while its working class suffers at their hands. Sympathetic to their plight, William James Moriarty wants to topple it all. Frustrated by the systemic inequity, Moriarty strategizes to fix the entire nation. Not even consulting detective Sherlock Holmes can stand in his way. It’s time for crime to revolutionize the world!","tagline_en":"It's time for crime to revolutionize the world!","runtime":24,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":2,"y":2022,"poster":"/gVnCdUtU5Iq9DZkUT91DvHO6RiF.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":24,"y":2020,"poster":"/bE68qjoUeQEkHD9sxC1pRJGMcK4.jpg"}],"episodes":24,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"斉藤壮馬","role":"William James Moriarty (voice)","photo":"/8W8Y02Jmjivw0kk5PDih9dqiyd9.jpg","en":"Soma Saito"},{"name":"佐藤拓也","role":"Albert James Moriarty (voice)","photo":"/xZgoTs6DOSneHkoOWL751pQzLru.jpg","en":"Takuya Sato"},{"name":"小林千晃","role":"Louis James Moriarty (voice)","photo":"/o0XZFXc50z28ICUpvfZ1QcTL2Yt.jpg","en":"Chiaki Kobayashi"},{"name":"古川慎","role":"Sherlock Holmes (voice)","photo":"/inLmBZhrqXeE9wlViyK28ocKJSw.jpg","en":"Makoto Furukawa"},{"name":"یوکی اونو","role":"John H. Watson (voice)","photo":"/oEx13CbNLsHzURdYafkFJYXDjfm.jpg","en":"Yuki Ono"},{"name":"日野聡","role":"Sebastian Moran (voice)","photo":"/8ZJIiwIVF2zDyyFr7oXewj0eEuu.jpg","en":"Satoshi Hino"},{"name":"上村祐翔","role":"Fred Porlock (voice)","photo":"/boQMSI9WA5x2LYDEsiq0udeKMNe.jpg","en":"Yuto Uemura"}],"trailer":"zDX2dfLqhjo","watch":{"US":{"link":"https